# Everything here is deployed to Linux. A systemd unit or an nginx config that
# arrives with CRLF line endings fails in ways that are tedious to diagnose —
# systemd treats the carriage return as part of the value, so ExecStart points
# at a binary whose name ends in an invisible character.
#
# Force LF on checkout regardless of the platform the file was edited on.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.conf      text eol=lf
*.service   text eol=lf
*.template  text eol=lf
*.md        text eol=lf
